3.	The Statement of Unaudited Consolidated Financial Results for the quarter ended June 30, 2025 have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their meetings held on October 28, 2025. The Statutory Auditors have reviewed these results pursuant to the requirements of Regulation 33 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended. There are no qualifications in the report issued by the auditors.	 &lt;BR&gt; 
